      "path": "cordis.patch.yml",
      "text": "# dsh-web-search-exa bundle layer: route web_search to Exa.\n#\n# dsh-base pins the web seam to its own DeepSeek search provider, so this\n# layer re-pins it to the `exa` provider this package registers. A patch\n# replaces the row's whole config, so fetchProvider keeps dsh-base's `http`.\n# The API key comes from $EXA_API_KEY (or set apiKeyFile in your profile's\n# own cordis.patch.yml); never put the key itself in a row.\n\n- id: web\n  config:\n    searchProvider: exa\n    fetchProvider: http\n\n- insert:\n    - id: web-search-exa\n      name: dsh-web-search-exa\n      config:\n        apiKeyEnv: EXA_API_KEY\n"
    }
