  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "dsh-web-search-exa",
      "text": "An [Exa](https://exa.ai) search provider for DeepSeek Harness. It registers the provider `exa`\non the `@deepseek-ai/dsh-web` seam, so the `web_search` tool sends its queries to Exa's\n`/search` API and returns the results as sources. It works the same from dsh web, dsh-TUI and\nheadless runs. `web_fetch` is unchanged. The plugin has no UI of its own."
    },
    {
      "section": "Install",
      "text": "The package is a dsh bundle. Use the profile you run (`web`, `headless`, …):\n\n```sh\ndsh plugin --profile web add github:jakehemmerle/dsh-web-search-exa#v0.3.0-rc.1\nexport EXA_API_KEY=…   # in the environment that launches dsh\n```\n\nThe bundle's [`cordis.patch.yml`](cordis.patch.yml) pins the web seam's `searchProvider` to\n`exa` and adds the `web-search-exa` row. Restart dsh web after installing."
    },
    {
      "section": "Install",
      "text": "This release is qualified against DSH `0.2.1-rc.2`; its peer pin is exact, so other DSH\nversions need `dsh plugin allow-version` or a newer release."
    },
    {
      "section": "Configuration",
      "text": "Override the row in your profile's own `cordis.patch.yml`. A patch replaces the whole row\nconfig, so restate any field you keep."
    },
    {
      "section": "Configuration",
      "text": "| Field | Default | Meaning |\n|---|---|---|\n| `apiKeyEnv` | `EXA_API_KEY` | Key name: looked up in dsh's credential store, then (after `apiKeyFile`) in the environment |\n| `apiKeyFile` | (unset) | File holding the key (raw or dotenv), read on every search, so a rotated key needs no restart; it wins over the environment |\n| `apiKey` | (unset) | Literal key, used before any other source (avoid) |\n| `baseURL` | `https://api.exa.ai` | Exa API origin |\n| `type` | `auto` | Exa search type |\n| `highlightChars` | `600` | Highlight length per result |\n| `timeoutMs` | `30000` | Request timeout |"
    },
    {
      "section": "Configuration",
      "text": "```yaml\n- id: web-search-exa\n  config:\n    apiKeyFile: /run/secrets/exa\n```"
    },
    {
      "section": "Development",
      "text": "`nix flake check` runs the fast suites against the pinned dsh; `nix run .#e2e` runs the real\ndsh web (Playwright), dsh-TUI (private tmux) and headless suites against a local mock Exa.\nSee [SPEC.md](SPEC.md), [TESTING.md](TESTING.md) and [RELEASING.md](RELEASING.md).\n\nLicense: MIT."
    }
  ],
